{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Raghned, a realm of humans and spirits, where it never gets dark. Your future vessel awaits you at the Trisun Temple. Her name is <strong>Fade</strong>, and together you are destined to travel down the mountain and put an end to the slow destruction of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Banner-2.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FORGET ABOUT THE 4TH WALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Player, you make a deal to take control over the main character, Fade, and are in constant communication with her after that. However, she is her own person, and your opinions on the best course of action may sometimes differ. How will you deal with that? Whether you choose to respect Fade's wishes or impose your authority will most definitely have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Dialogue.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MORALITY-BASED LEVEL UP SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have to kill anyone, but nothing stops you from doing so. Will you be merciless or merciful? Your decisions will grant you access to 2 separate skill trees with different spells. This way, your gameplay experience is shaped by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DAY AND NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, day and night coexisted in an endless cycle, but they were separated into the Dayworld and the Nightworld. Not for you though. You are able to travel between those overlapping realities in order to solve puzzles and defeat enemies, who are frozen in time while you're Nightwalking.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Combat.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RESURRECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will never be defeated unless you accept defeat. One of your special powers is to resurrect Fade as many times as you want instead of loading your last save. There is no limit, only a disturbing price to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Ressurection.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEET SPIRITS, SHAPESHIFTERS, REVOLUTIONARIES AND MORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a rest in a magical forest, uncover otherworldly secrets, or pick a side in a revolution! A diverse cast of characters is waiting to meet you in the unique world of Raghned. Whether they will regret ever crossing your path is up to you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Banner-3.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433000?t=1749330607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749330607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/aadc35ca2c841b06f98d7bc5c04a8e9ca05491ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749330607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/aadc35ca2c841b06f98d7bc5c04a8e9ca05491ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749330607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General violence through combat; psychological torture."},"demos":[{"appid":3459650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Raghned, a realm of humans and spirits, where it never gets dark. Your future vessel awaits you at the Trisun Temple. Her name is <strong>Fade</strong>, and together you are destined to travel down the mountain and put an end to the slow destruction of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Banner-2.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FORGET ABOUT THE 4TH WALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Player, you make a deal to take control over the main character, Fade, and are in constant communication with her after that. However, she is her own person, and your opinions on the best course of action may sometimes differ. How will you deal with that? Whether you choose to respect Fade's wishes or impose your authority will most definitely have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Dialogue.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MORALITY-BASED LEVEL UP SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have to kill anyone, but nothing stops you from doing so. Will you be merciless or merciful? Your decisions will grant you access to 2 separate skill trees with different spells. This way, your gameplay experience is shaped by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DAY AND NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, day and night coexisted in an endless cycle, but they were separated into the Dayworld and the Nightworld. Not for you though. You are able to travel between those overlapping realities in order to solve puzzles and defeat enemies, who are frozen in time while you're Nightwalking.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Combat.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RESURRECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will never be defeated unless you accept defeat. One of your special powers is to resurrect Fade as many times as you want instead of loading your last save. There is no limit, only a disturbing price to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Ressurection.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEET SPIRITS, SHAPESHIFTERS, REVOLUTIONARIES AND MORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a rest in a magical forest, uncover otherworldly secrets, or pick a side in a revolution! A diverse cast of characters is waiting to meet you in the unique world of Raghned. Whether they will regret ever crossing your path is up to you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/extras/Banner-3.gif?t=1749330607\" /></p>","developers":["Sisterhood Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433000/772164ac624bac95ac446d8e9d5fa05412c18ffd/header.jpg?t=1749330607","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153065,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153065/movie480.mp4?t=1749330603","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153065/movie_max.mp4?t=1749330603"},"name":"Women-Led Games x SGF 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153065/8cb4c1f7c261cc67a4cdfb96ea450a7ac5061c49/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749330603","webm":{"480":"http://vid