 you are controlling her. How will you act when faced with the temptations of absolute power over someone so vulnerable \u2014 all while on a mission to save a revolution-torn realm from an unnatural disaster?","steam_appid":3433000,"support_info":{"email":"dwnhllspprt@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}